      "level": 18,
      "parentId": "srd521.subclass.fighter.champion",
      "text": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "kind": "ParagraphNode",
            "text": "You attain the pinnacle of resilience in battle, giving you these benefits. Defy Death. You have Advantage on Death Saving Throws. Moreover, when you roll 18–20 on a Death Saving Throw, you gain the benefit of rolling a 20 on it. Heroic Rally. At the start of each of your turns, you regain Hit Points equal to 5 plus your Constitution modifier if you are Bloodied and have at least 1 Hit Point."
          }
        ],
        "title": "Survivor"
      }
    },
